{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">When Ribbit the frog astronaut runs out of spaceship fuel mid-journey, he crash-lands onto a magical floating island world. Luckily, he meets friendly villagers who guide him on a cozy, delightful adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">With the villagers' help, Ribbit explores various floating islands, each with unique themes:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Grass Island</strong>: A lovely, lush landscape perfect for gentle exploration.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Gothic Ruins Island</strong>: Mysterious and intriguing ancient structures await your discovery.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Village Island: Cozy and peaceful, enjoy 'Retirement Life' here.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579880/extras/Islands.gif?t=1743197534\" /></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Key features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83e\ude99 <strong>Collect &amp; Explore</strong>: Enjoy continuous fun collecting items and interacting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579880/extras/gameplays.gif?t=1743197534\" /></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\ude80 <strong>Pilot Your Aircraft</strong>: Freely fly between the main island (village island) and the whale island.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579880/extras/flight.gif?t=1743197534\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udfdd\ufe0f <strong>Relaxing Gameplay</strong>: Casual, stress-free gameplay suitable for players of all ages.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udcac <strong>Fun NPC Interactions</strong>: Engaging characters and heartwarming mini-stories enrich your exploration.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Relax, collect, explore, and enjoy a stress-free journey suitable for players of all ages!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3579880?t=1743197534","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579880/1a78ebbde6c4eee30f4050ebb49c3a9f1d712224/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1743197534","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579880/e97a78be201ef1f078dde436dcaca1972035e396/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1743197534","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579880/e97a78be201ef1f078dde436dcaca1972035e396/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1743197534","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">When Ribbit the frog astronaut runs out of spaceship fuel mid-journey, he crash-lands onto a magical floating island world. Luckily, he meets friendly villagers who guide him on a cozy, delightful adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">With the villagers' help, Ribbit explores various floating islands, each with unique themes:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Grass Island</strong>: A lovely, lush landscape perfect for gentle exploration.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Gothic Ruins Island</strong>: Mysterious and intriguing ancient structures await your discovery.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Village Island: Cozy and peaceful, enjoy 'Retirement Life' here.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579880/extras/Islands.gif?t=1743197534\" /></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Key features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83e\ude99 <strong>Collect &amp; Explore</strong>: Enjoy continuous fun collecti